* MKS-20 CPU B (Sound Engine) - f9dasm info file
* HD63B03RP, ROM descrambled, mapped at E000-FFFF
* Very similar to RD200 CPU B but with different memory layout:
*   - RAM variables at 0x0020-0x00A6 instead of 0x0080-0x00ED
*   - 16 voices, $60 bytes per voice in external RAM (0x0200-0x0800)
*   - Simplified command set (no pedal commands, no param update)
*   - Different command numbering (cmd 0x00=note-off, 0x40=pgmchg, etc.)

OPTION 6301

