* =============================================
* DATA: Command dispatch table (E164-E183)
* 16 x 2-byte pointers, indexed by (cmd & 0xF0) >> 3
*
* Command mapping (different from RD200!):
*   0x00 -> E671 cmd_00_note_off
*   0x10 -> E2E2 cmd_10_set_env_init
*   0x20 -> 0000 (unused)
*   0x30 -> 0000 (unused)
*   0x40 -> E191 cmd_40_program_change
*   0x50 -> 0000 (unused)
*   0x60 -> 0000 (unused)
*   0x70 -> 0000 (unused)
*   0x80 -> E2F0 cmd_80_note_on_L1
*   0x90 -> 0000 (unused)
*   0xA0 -> E2EA cmd_A0_note_on_L2
*   0xB0 -> 0000 (unused)
*   0xC0 -> E2E2 cmd_C0_set_env_init
*   0xD0 -> 0000 (unused)
*   0xE0 -> E184 cmd_E0_tuning
*   0xF0 -> EC43 cmd_F0_config
*
* Note: MKS-20 has NO pedal commands (50/60/70),
* NO param update commands (80/A0 in RD200),
* NO voice reset/update commands (00/10/90 in RD200)
* =============================================
WORD E164-E183
LABEL E164 cmd_dispatch_table

